- Progressive Decentralization: Centralized start dengan concrete technical roadmap ke Stage 2【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 9 — Risk Response Pattern】
- Dual Governance: Token-weighted + soulbound badge voting untuk different functions【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern】
- Public Goods Funding Core: RetroPGF sebagai differentiator dan builder flywheel【Phase 3 — EV-024】【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern】
- Infrastructure Agnostic: Multiple providers untuk reduce single points of failure【Phase 7 — Infrastructure Providers】【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern】
